===Etymology===
{{etyl|ML.|en}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|ἑv||lang=grc|tr=hen}}, stem of {{term|ἑις||lang=grc|tr=heis|one}} + {{term|διά||lang=grc|tr=dia|through}} + {{term|δυοίν||lang=grc|tr=dyoin|two}}

===Pronunciation===
